  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Wake up to salt air and sunshine at Olive & Arrow — a warm, beautifully designed three-story coastal retreat in the heart of Inlet Beach, built for families and groups who want it all. Sleeps up to 14 guests across four bedrooms and bonus sleeping spaces, with room to gather, play, and truly unwind.<br><br>*** Exciting updates arriving mid-April! Olive & Arrow is currently being reimagined with a brand-new game room, theatre room, updated kids' bunk room, outdoor yard games, additional seating, bikes, beach supplies, and more. Bookings from mid-April onward will enjoy all of these upgraded features — updated photos coming soon!<br><br>When you're ready for the Gulf, grab the complimentary bikes and ride to 30A's largest public beach access in just 5 minutes via the dedicated pedestrian underpass — a safe, car-free path that makes the trip easy and stress-free, even with little ones in tow. Miles of sugar-white sand and emerald water await.<br><br>Just steps from your front door, the community pool is the perfect place to spend a lazy afternoon — featuring a vaulted pavilion, lounge chairs, and restrooms and changing facilities, so you have everything you need without ever going far. It's the kind of convenience that makes a family vacation feel effortless.<br><br>The main floor is designed for gathering. A bright, open-concept living area flows into a chef's kitchen outfitted with a gas range, double wall ovens, stainless appliances, and a quartz island with seating for four. The dining table seats six, and just off the back is a screened porch with a wood-planked ceiling and ceiling fan — your new favorite spot for morning coffee or evening drinks.<br><br>Upstairs, the second-floor loft connects the bedrooms and features a sofa sleeper and wall-mounted TV — perfect for teens or little ones. The third floor is being transformed into the most fun floor in the house: a themed game room with a wet bar, beverage fridge, wall-mounted TV, and private balcony.<br><br>Outside, a fully fenced yard with native coastal landscaping is ideal for kids and groups. The community pool with a vaulted pavilion, lounge chairs, and restrooms is just steps from your front door. And getting to the beach is a breeze — use the dedicated pedestrian underpass for safe, car-free access to the Gulf, no traffic to worry about.<br><br>Guests love that everything is right at your fingertips — bikes to borrow, beach gear ready to go, and a location that puts 30A's best within easy reach.<br><br>Bedrooms & Bathrooms<br><br>Bedroom 1 — King Suite (1st Floor)<br>Private king suite with screened porch access, large walk-in closet (Pack 'n Play included), and a gorgeous en suite with dual vanities and an oversized walk-in shower.<br><br>Bedroom 2 — King Suite (2nd Floor)<br>Light and airy king suite with a spacious walk-in closet (Pack 'n Play included) and a spa-worthy en suite featuring dual vanities and a large walk-in shower.<br><br>Bedroom 3 — Queen (2nd Floor)<br>Bright queen bedroom with private balcony access. Shares a well-appointed hall bath (tub/shower combo) with the bunk room.<br><br>Bedroom 4 — Kids' Bunk Room (2nd Floor)<br>A perfect retreat for the little ones, with a bunk bed sleeping up to 3. Shares the hall bath with Bedroom 3. Being updated mid-April with a fresh new theme!<br><br>Loft (2nd Floor) Open-air loft with a full sofa sleeper — best suited for children or teenagers.<br><br><br>Key Features<br><br>* Sleeps up to 14 guests<br>* 4 bedrooms: 2 kings, 1 queen, kids' bunk room + sofa sleeper loft<br>3.5 bathrooms (2 en suite)<br>* Chef's kitchen with gas range, double wall ovens & quartz island<br>* Game room with wet bar (arriving mid-April)<br>* Theatre room (arriving mid-April)<br>* Community pool access — steps from your front door<br>* Screened back porch + covered front porch<br>* Ultra-Fast 1GB Wifi with eero Mesh: Experience lightning-fast 1,000 Mbps speeds throughout the entire home. Our eero mesh system (with 2 dedicated routers) ensures a rock-solid connection in every room—perfect for remote work and streaming on our Roku Smart TVs.<br>*Smart Entertainment: All rooms feature Roku-enabled Smart TVs. Easily sign into your favorite streaming apps (Netflix, Hulu, etc.) using Guest Mode.<br>* Fully fenced yard<br>* Kid-friendly amenities: 2 Pack 'n Plays, books, toys, and more<br>* Dedicated pedestrian underpass for safe, car-free beach access<br><br>**To help you settle in, we provide a complementary starter pack including:<br> -2 dishwasher pods & 2 laundry pods<br> -1 roll of paper towels & 2 rolls of toilet paper per bathroom<br> -All-purpose cleaner, dish soap, and a fresh sponge<br> -A selection of coffee pods and basic spices<br> Please note: These supplies are intended to get you through your first 24- 48 hours. For longer stays, we recommend a quick trip to the nearby Publix at Watersound Town Center to restock.<br><br><br>The Neighborhood<br><br>Olive & Arrow is nestled in the serene Preserve at Inlet Beach community, offering the perfect blend of peaceful surroundings and easy access to everything that makes 30A so special. You're just a 5-minute walk from 30A Avenue, putting local restaurants, boutique shops, and ice cream spots right at your doorstep.<br><br>The home is ideally positioned for exploring the iconic communities along 30A. Rosemary Beach is just a 5-minute bike ride away, and the striking architecture and upscale dining of Alys Beach is only a short drive further. Whether you're browsing local shops, grabbing fresh seafood, or soaking in the laid-back 30A atmosphere, everything is right at your fingertips.<br><br>For a little extra adventure, the area has plenty to offer the whole family. Paddle through the serene waters of Camp Helen State Park or glide across crystal-clear Lake Powell on a kayak or paddleboard. Budding ocean lovers will be captivated by the 30A Sea Life Discovery Center in Grayton Beach, where kids can snorkel with sea turtles, kayak across coastal dune lakes, and join evening scavenger hunts. Catch some waves with a surf lesson through Austin Magee's Surf School in Seaside, offering camps and lessons for all skill levels. And for bigger day trips, spend a peaceful afternoon at Eden Gardens State Park, make a splash at Big Kahuna's Water Park in Destin, or discover marine life at Gulf World Marine Park in Panama City Beach — unforgettable experiences just a short drive away.<br><br>House Rules<br><br>We want Olive & Arrow to be a special place for every guest — we kindly ask that you help us keep it that way.<br><br>* The primary renter must be at least 25 years old.<br>* Parties and large events are strictly prohibited.<br>* Due to a severe allergy in our household, Olive & Arrow is a strictly animal-free home. We are unable to accommodate any animals of any kind, including service & support animals. We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your understanding in helping us keep our home safe for everyone.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Olive & Arrow - 30A Coastal Retreat – Steps from the Beach & Pool"
        }
      ],
